    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44352" root="&#xA;                        هم&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهِمٌّ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A difficult, an arduous, a distressing, or
an afflictive affair,</i> or <i>business:</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْرٌ شَدِيدٌ</span>:
(S:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهِمَّاتٌ</span> signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمُورُ شِدَادٌ</span>, (JK,) <i>affairs
of difficulty:</i> and, <i>of importance.</i>
